Description: BoxCloud GStreamer plugins for Rockchip platforms.
 Hardware-accelerated video encoding and decoding for RK3588 using MPP and RGA.
 Includes critical fixes for DMA allocation, encoder stability, and decoder
 output corruption prevention.
